z) & =\\frac{∂g}{∂x}i+\\frac{∂g}{∂y}j+\\frac{∂g}{∂z}k=(- \\frac{1}{x^{2} y z})\\,i+(- \\frac{1}{x y^{2} z})\\,j+(- \\frac{1}{x y z^{2}})\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇[f(x,y,z)g(x,y,z)] & =g(x,y,z)∇f(x,y,z)+f(x,y,z)∇g(x,y,z) \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{x y z})((2 x y^{3} z - y z^{3})\\,i+(3 x^{2} y^{2} z - x z^{3})\\,j+(x^{2} y^{3} - 3 x y z^{2})\\,k)+(x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3})((- \\frac{1}{x^{2} y z})\\,i+(- \\frac{1}{x y^{2} z})\\,j+(- \\frac{1}{x y z^{2}})\\,k) \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{x y z})(2 x y^{3} z - y z^{3})i+(\\frac{1}{x y z})(3 x^{2} y^{2} z - x z^{3})j+(\\frac{1}{x y z})(x^{2} y^{3} - 3 x y z^{2})k+(x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3})(- \\frac{1}{x^{2} y z})i+(x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3})(- \\frac{1}{x y^{2} z})j+(x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3})(- \\frac{1}{x y z^{2}})k \\\\  & =(2 y^{2} - \\frac{z^{2}}{x})i+(3 x y - \\frac{z^{2}}{y})j+(\\frac{x y^{2}}{z} - 3 z)k+(- y^{2} + \\frac{z^{2}}{x})i+(- x y + \\frac{z^{2}}{y})j+(- \\frac{x y^{2}}{z} + z)k \\\\  & =(y^{2})\\,i+(2 x y)\\,j+(- 2 z)\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535644 17592186045443 true] [17592186524178 1080 "(4 x + 4 y)\\,i+(- 12 x + 4 y)\\,j" 13194139535644 17592186045443 true] [17592186524178 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535644 17592186045443 true] [17592186524178 1083 #uuid "b0f45f57-3302-5746-b510-260125a96661" 13194139535644 17592186045443 true] [17592186524179 1068 #edb/ref 17592186524151 13194139535644 17592186045443 true] [17592186524179 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139535644 17592186045443 true] [17592186524179 1071 "Find the gradient of the product $f(x,y)g(x,y),$ given that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y) & =- 2 x + 2 y,\\quad ∇f(x,y)=(-2)\\,i+(2)\\,j \\\\ g(x,y) & =- x - y,\\quad ∇g(x,y)=(-1)\\,i+(-1)\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535644 17592186045443 true] [17592186524179 1072 #uuid "b4b60a1d-d5a3-5373-aeeb-9fd900ce0e06" 13194139535644 17592186045443 true] [17592186524179 1074 "The gradient of the product of two functions $f(x,y)$ and $g(x,y)